      <div type="clause" n="6">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Northleoda">Norðleod.</ref> 6</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Ceorles wergild is CC 7 LXVI þrimsa, þæt bið II hund scill'. be Myrcna lage.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">A ceorl's wergild is 266 thrymsas, which is 200 shillings according to the law of the Mercians.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ceorles wergyld is CC 7 VI 7 LX þrymsa, þæt bið twahund scyllinga be Myrcna lage.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryTranslation" xml:lang="en">A layman's wergild is two-hundred and sixty-six thrymsas, that is, two hundred shillings according to the law of the Mercians.</ab>
      </div>
